    <user>dimstar_suse</user>
    <comment>Update to version 0.8.2

Upstream adds command line options to perseustest so all Perseus hardware
features can be exercised from the command line.

Packaging: 0.8.2 newly installs libperseus-sdr.pc, now packaged in -devel;
obsolete Group tags dropped; Requires(pre) moved from the long-removed pwdutils
to shadow. The two rpmlint errors (no-binary on the udev subpackage,
explicit-lib-dependency) are pre-existing and unchanged by this update.</comment>
